    {
      "name": "data_prep",
      "displayName": "How the data was prepared",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "w17",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## How the data was prepared\n",
                "- **Order:** one customer, one day, one channel (the data has no order ID).\n",
                "- **Channel 1 = store:** its orders fall to zero while stores were closed in spring 2020.\n",
                "- **Cohorts start Aug 2019:** before that, most \"new\" customers were existing ones the data had not seen yet.\n",
                "- **90-day window:** catches about 60% of the returns that happen within a year, and keeps the spring 2020 cohorts measurable.\n",
                "- Prices are scaled by H&M, so no currency appears anywhere.\n"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 3
          }
        },
